{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_06_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_06","title":"“復仇於我”","storyCode":"PV-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"557a8a3e4c4898ae29e5fcb6e9707a3e26b68082da08fb5d1374870afc8f39b0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    10:17 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就是這樣，柳德米拉，該說的我都跟你說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幫威尼斯運的是什麼貨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上是一批輪胎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基本都是載具生產會用到的耗材，源石引擎、鋼件、合金之類的，有時候也有一些凍鱗、凍肉或酒精藥品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事情在敘拉古的其他城市很常見，家族的商品基本都不走正常的報關流程，能省很大一筆稅。只不過在新沃爾西尼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用說那麼多，我懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是第一次了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……柳德米拉，你今天晚上不跟他們去拍電影，就是因為我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是從什麼時候發現的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹嘛一直跟著我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我和魯傑羅真的很忙！可以請你離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忙到連喝杯咖啡的時間都沒有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，索默爾、魯傑羅，你們的戒心太重了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是新沃爾西尼，大家都是新沃爾西尼市民，日後相處的時間還長，彼此交流一下感情還是很有必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，我們乾脆在你們營地對面開個咖啡館好了，那麼多司機，不擔心沒生意，而且也方便我們見面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況，咳咳——從哪裡吹來這麼大的煙，我的眼睛都快瞎了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，*敘拉古粗口*誰打我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲喂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾、魯傑羅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們什麼都不知道！你也看到了，我們兩個離你好幾步遠，我們站在原地動都沒動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道的，我們不會法術……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說，這個地塊之所以被劃為最外圍地塊，在市政廳撥給我們建卡車營地之前都沒有規劃，就是因為這裡以前是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少、少說那些沒用的，這次就先饒過你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因為那次你幫了我們，大家才慢慢和你熟起來，纏著你問那神奇的源石技藝是怎麼回事，纏著你問烏薩斯的見聞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……家族的人找上你，自然不會只是“看你不爽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那之後，他們還是在繼續糾纏你。索默爾，你為什麼沒再跟我說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要幫小古莉治病，要接她來新沃爾西尼生活，我很需要那筆錢，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且說了能怎麼樣呢，他們是一群不達目的不甘休的惡狼，我不想給互助會的其他人添麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家是生活在一起的兄弟姐妹，但這些兄弟姐妹也都只是一群再單純不過的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉腦海裡閃過卡車司機們那一張張臉，沒有接話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，瞞著柳德米拉了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，她在自己的帳篷裡待著呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一個新來的，來了營地之後就沒摘下過那副面罩，每次皺起眉頭……反正我心裡都不是滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。這幾天有她在場，真是憋死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點快點——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳、柳德米拉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思不好意思，我們馬上要開夜車，想出車前抽根煙提提神來著——不提也可以的！我們馬上就掐掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，抽煙不用特意避開我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的結晶不是位置比較特殊嘛……大家以為你戴著面罩，是因為呼吸道很脆弱什麼的。司機們抽煙抽習慣了，我們就想說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡車司機B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們希望你能喜歡這裡，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待會到前面的路口，你下去等我吧。快到了，讓威尼斯的人看到我帶了不相干的人，會有麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別說那麼多了。我已經上了車，今晚這一趟我會陪你走完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，幸好有你陪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼♪哼哼哼♪哼~~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾，從剛剛開始你都循環這首歌好幾遍了，還沒膩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《不期而會》，多好聽的歌，Sora小姐的歌聲多麼美妙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是這週最熱門的單曲，聽採訪說這是Sora小姐特意為這次狂歡節錄製的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不期而會”，我沒什麼文化，但我知道這是一個好詞……你不覺得它就是在講我們這些人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，你會離開，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說你在敘拉古已經沒有任何親人和朋友了，你沒地方可去，大家都很樂意營地裡以後能多一個像你這樣有趣的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和伊雷妮討論過這件事情，我覺得，你不會一直留在卡車互助會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼睛裡有懷疑，也有恨，雖然我不知道那到底是對誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得自己第一次看見伊雷妮時的樣子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得有什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒來的時候發現自己已經在營地裡了，你和伊雷妮站在我面前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看見伊雷妮，眼神一下子就變了……雖然很快就恢復了正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把她認成了別人，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是剛醒，有點恍惚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯珀女性、紅色的連帽衫、脖子上戴著防具……伊雷妮確實讓我想起了一個討厭的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是在炎國，還是敘拉古，每次遇見那個人，我都會變得很倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我不想去問那些烏薩斯的故事到底是你聽來的還是你的親身經歷，我們也沒必要爭到底誰的人生更倒楣一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當是倒楣蛋們不期而會了吧，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮那丫頭總說，再倒楣的人也會被生活眷顧的，只是會晚一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉沒有說話，車轉過一個路口，她隨意地扭頭看了窗外一眼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死——方向盤怎麼突然之間不聽使喚了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，索默爾，那邊有輛車——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真狼，紅終於找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅不會放過你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，沒看到嗎？你的刀和我的箭扎爆了他們的輪胎，不救人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞，你說得對，狩獵的時候不該分心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉覺得自己頭痛欲裂。\n她奮力扯開安全帶，推開車門，從座椅上跌落。臉撞到地面的瞬間，她看見熟悉的紅色身影消失在路口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……"},{"type":"narration","text":"暈眩感還沒有從腦海消失，她來不及確認現場的情況，來不及看看索默爾有沒有事——憤怒，一直以來的憤怒像是潮水一樣席捲而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真倒楣啊——怎麼又是你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個——該死的狼崽子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去在敘拉古，我處理過比這更棘手的情況，同時動手的人也更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無一例外，躺下的絕不會是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別將人與獸群等同，你狩獵野獸的那套技巧，在我面前沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可繼續試試。當然，你也是，“紅”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會找到你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅的刀，需要更鋒利……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒辦法躲太久的。瓦古欠我的答案，我已經等不了了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"突然冒出來的沃爾珀，紅失敗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的狼崽子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我終於找到你了，這次你又想若無其事地走掉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼又是你？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉再次揮刀，被紅靈巧地閃過，緊接著自己的背上挨了重重一腳，手被擒住，刀掉落在了地上。\n等到反應過來的時候，她已經被狠狠地壓在了地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，嗚——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"臉與地面摩擦的劇烈痛感在一瞬間喚醒了柳德米拉的回憶——\n龍門的小巷裡，自己也是被這個可惡的狼崽子像這般制伏，幾乎喪失反抗的能力。\n一模一樣的姿勢，一模一樣的痛感。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，我的手臂——放開我，*烏薩斯粗口**敘拉古粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這人渣，在龍門，我終於能夠報仇的時候，為什麼你要擋在凱爾希面前？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師她明明沒辦法再戰鬥了，為什麼你還是要殺她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你要一次又一次出現在我面前？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我，殺不了你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（鬱悶地呲牙）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……紅記得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅是獵狼人，你不是真狼，紅沒有必要殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希說過，我們不該殺死一條沒家的鬣狗。你很痛苦，凱爾希不希望紅殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆還在等紅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅沒有時間耗在這裡，紅還要去找最後的真狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"別再妨礙紅。紅已經離開了羅德島，紅已經沒有聽凱爾希的話了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"身穿紅色連帽衫的魯珀沒有一刻停留，轉瞬間消失在了巷子深處。\n柳德米拉沒有起身，她躺在地面上，摀住自己幾乎脫臼的手臂，等待疼痛和屈辱將自己淹沒。\n她突然回想起了索默爾說的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當是倒楣蛋們不期而會了吧，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮那丫頭總說，再倒楣的人也會被生活眷顧的，只是會晚一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾，真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾……對了，索默爾……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，只顧著追這個可惡的狼崽子，忘了索默爾還在那輛車上……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["紅"]}]}
